1
00:00:01,267 --> 00:00:02,185
Hello.

2
00:00:02,185 --> 00:00:04,481
We are going to make a letter V.

3
00:00:04,481 --> 00:00:05,739

4
00:00:05,739 --> 00:00:09,103
(birds chirping)

5
00:00:09,103 --> 00:00:12,479
Inflate a balloon leaving a four inch flat tail.

6
00:00:12,479 --> 00:00:21,593

7
00:00:21,593 --> 00:00:24,819
Twist the first soft two inch bubble.

8
00:00:24,819 --> 00:00:25,731

9
00:00:25,731 --> 00:00:29,061
Lock both ends of the first bubble in one lock twist.

10
00:00:29,061 --> 00:00:35,650

11
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:38,649
Twist the second six inch bubble.

12
00:00:38,649 --> 00:00:41,061

13
00:00:41,061 --> 00:00:42,679
Twist the third soft

14
00:00:42,679 --> 00:00:45,402
two inch bubble.

15
00:00:45,402 --> 00:00:47,050
Lock both ends of the third bubble

16
00:00:47,050 --> 00:00:49,811
in one lock twist.

17
00:00:49,811 --> 00:00:58,096

18
00:00:58,096 --> 00:01:01,559
Twist the fourth six inch bubble.

19
00:01:01,559 --> 00:01:03,696

20
00:01:03,696 --> 00:01:05,167
Twist the fifth soft

21
00:01:05,167 --> 00:01:07,670
two inch bubble.

22
00:01:07,670 --> 00:01:09,729
Lock both ends of the fifth bubble

23
00:01:09,729 --> 00:01:13,147
in one lock twist.

24
00:01:13,147 --> 00:01:16,559
The rest of the balloon is the sixth bubble.

25
00:01:16,559 --> 00:01:18,894
(Bird chirping)

26
00:01:18,894 --> 00:01:25,863

27
00:01:25,863 --> 00:01:27,453
Cut off the sixth bubble.

28
00:01:27,453 --> 00:01:29,649
And tie off the ends.

29
00:01:29,649 --> 00:01:36,937

30
00:01:36,937 --> 00:01:40,769
Fix all bubbles in proper positions.

31
00:01:40,769 --> 00:01:41,778
Congratulations.

32
00:01:41,778 --> 00:01:44,675
You have made the capital letter V.

33
00:01:44,675 --> 00:01:45,875

34
00:01:45,875 --> 00:01:47,941
Chose appropriate color sewing thread

35
00:01:47,941 --> 00:01:50,563
to fix the sculpture in shape of the letter V.

36
00:01:50,563 --> 00:01:56,282
And to link it with other letters.

37
00:01:56,282 --> 00:01:58,704
As you can see here,

38
00:01:58,704 --> 00:02:00,786
the light color thread is visible

39
00:02:00,786 --> 00:02:03,433
on a dark background.

40
00:02:03,433 --> 00:02:10,231

41
00:02:10,231 --> 00:02:12,729
After you made and connect all letters in words,

42
00:02:12,729 --> 00:02:14,601
you can attach the sign you made

43
00:02:14,601 --> 00:02:22,928
to a wall with sticky tape.

44
00:02:22,928 --> 00:02:24,097
Have fun :)

45
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Subtitles by the Amara.org community

